  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-11-25T20:09:53.429Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I believe the current default is \"Poor\" and this causes a lot of confusion. Avatars meeting the \"Poor\" ranking of Quest are still very lightweight. And this is causing communication issues by blocking writing (Trail Renderers) of others, for all new Quest users.\n\nAnother solution would be to allow for one Trail Renderer at Medium rank.\n\nThank you for your time!",
